    "title": "One Rescued After Explosive Apartment Fire in Mar Vista - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MAR VISTA- At least one person was rescued Wednesday after an explosive fire tore through a three-story apartment building in the Mar Vista neighborhood, authorities said. The blaze broke out in the 3400 block of South Sawtelle Boulevard and was quickly extinguished, according to the Los Angeles Fire Department. The condition of the person rescued was not immediately known. The cause of the fire remains under investigation.",
